{"output":"I’ll inspect project authorization and caching, fix the isolation issues, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject reads lack a membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll check ownership before reads and updates, add an unambiguous organization prefix to list keys, and invalidate only that organization’s list variants. List authorization already runs before cache lookup and will stay there.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache hits still require membership.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 10 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates every affected organization variant without evicting unrelated lists. Cache hits still require membership.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 10 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":25,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-iincv9nu/tenant-cache-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":185,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-07819b2740a4b005bdb17ab1252913c6.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"succ